{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35160","headline":"诗品二十四则 清奇 · 司空图","name":"诗品二十四则 清奇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"娟娟羣松，下有漪流。\n晴雪满汀，隔溪渔舟。\n可人如玉，步屧寻幽。\n载行载止，空碧悠悠。\n神出古异，淡不可收。\n如月之曙，如气之秋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"司空图","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35160.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35160","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}